    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.VerifyRSA(PublicKey: string, Message: string, Signature: string, Algorithm: string): boolean`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llVerifyRSA(string PublicKey, string Message, string Signature, string Algorithm);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) indicating whether the [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&amp;#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA_(cryptosystem" target="_blank">RSA</a>) <b>signature</b> is valid for <b>msg</b> when using hash algorithm <b>algorithm</b> and public RSA key <b>public_key</b>. Returns <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if the signature is verified, and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> otherwise. Can be paired with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSignRSA" target="_blank">llSignRSA</a> to validate the authenticity of messages from other LSL scripts.</p>
</p>
